  wrapped by `<div className={\`w-auto flex flex-row justify-start items-center text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:opacity-80 ${className}\`}>` and preceded by `ResourceIcon`. Audio resources render `<audio src={resourceUrl} controls></audio>` instead.

6. Reader navigation / toolbar / pagination / top bar.
- The only reader toolbar/top bar is Reader.tsx line 13:
  <header className="reader-toolbar"><h1>Public memo reader</h1><a href="/explore">Open Memos</a></header>
