- Because /reader is a top-level route (not a child of App/RootLayout/HomeLayout), it does not render the normal app sidebar/nav/top bar used by other pages.
- Backend ListMemos supports `pageSize`/`pageToken` and returns `nextPageToken` (server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go lines 158-200), but the Reader frontend does not consume it.

